WEBVTT

00:10:27.854 --> 00:10:30.604
KFL: That's a really good question.

00:10:30.628 --> 00:10:32.538
From the first part of your question,

00:10:32.562 --> 00:10:37.434
I think people do hold
this disbelief at technology,

00:10:37.458 --> 00:10:39.410
but once a product comes out,

00:10:39.434 --> 00:10:41.791
people embrace and accept it quickly.

00:10:41.815 --> 00:10:45.029
So speech recognition
through Alexa and Siri

00:10:45.053 --> 00:10:46.218
is a great example.

00:10:46.242 --> 00:10:49.791
Five years ago, nobody was using
speech recognition,

00:10:49.815 --> 00:10:51.387
now everybody uses it.

00:10:51.411 --> 00:10:54.323
So the same will happen
with machine translation.

00:10:54.347 --> 00:10:56.086
And there are implications,

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:59.355
I think it's interesting
that in the short-term,

00:10:59.379 --> 00:11:02.776
there are actually more translators
who are getting paid,